# Required. Free hosted Postgres via Supabase (https://supabase.com):
# 1. Create a project (free tier, no card required).
# 2. Project Settings -> Database -> Connection string -> "Connection pooling"
#    tab (Transaction mode, port 6543) -> copy the URI.
# 3. Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] in that URI with your database password.
#
# Needed for local dev too (npm run db:push, npm run dev) since there is no
# local-file fallback with Postgres. Set this in Vercel's project environment
# variables as well when deploying.
DATABASE_URL=
